<!--
  RoboSim Eval: Fast DDS profile shared by Isaac Sim 6.1 (Windows) and ROS 2 Jazzy (WSL2 Ubuntu).

  Derived from IsaacSim-ros_workspaces tag IsaacSim-6.1.0, file jazzy_ws/fastdds.xml, which matches the
  fastdds.xml shown in the Isaac Sim 6.1 "ROS 2 installation" WSL2 section. One change: the upstream file has a
  separate <license> element before <profiles>, i.e. two root elements, which is not well-formed XML. The license
  text is kept below as a comment so this document has a single root and passes an XML parser on both sides.

  Effect: UDPv4 transport only, built-in transports (including shared memory) disabled, so the Windows host and
  WSL2 can discover each other over the vEthernet (WSL) link.

  Windows: set FASTRTPS_DEFAULT_PROFILES_FILE=D:\RoboSim-Eval\configs\network\fastdds.xml (done by
  scripts\windows\start_isaac_ros2.ps1). WSL: source scripts/wsl/dds_env.sh, which points at
  /mnt/d/RoboSim-Eval/configs/network/fastdds.xml.

  Upstream license:
